        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cart Capers</strong> is a light-hearted physics game where you ride through strange dream-like levels — without ever stepping off your cart.<br>Each run feels like a fever dream you half-remember: odd, funny, and a little confusing in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll roll, jump, and steer your cart across 7 different “Dreams.”<br>Every level offers new layouts and obstacles to bounce through, and every run brings a different character behind the cart. You can play solo or with up to 5 players, trying to stay on track and make it to the end together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, unpredictable physics, and shared chaos make Cart Capers a game you’ll laugh about with your friends — or with yourself, wondering what you just dreamt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dream levels to play through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 5-player multiplayer support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters and carts each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-air steering , wheelies and Pushing the cart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/02bd80f5c7b4451b5972c2ee1f5a12e8.poster.avif?t=1772220322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/02bd80f5c7b4451b5972c2ee1f5a12e8.webm?t=1772220322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/02bd80f5c7b4451b5972c2ee1f5a12e8.mp4?t=1772220322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick runs and easy pick-up-and-play gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/d54329d37475496443a82f20dc06a18f.poster.avif?t=1772220322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/d54329d37475496443a82f20dc06a18f.webm?t=1772220322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582170/extras/d54329d37475496443a82f20dc06a18f.mp4?t=1772220322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you start rolling, you can’t stop — or get off.<br>It’s just you, your cart, and a dream that makes no sense, but somehow feels familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
